  "result": "Two separate decisions, each isolated to one function:\n\n1. **Which organizations are due when the scheduler ticks** — `shouldRunForOrg()` in `src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts` (L84-87). It checks that the org isn't archived and that `now.getUTCHours()` matches the org's configured `digestHourUtc`, so each org is only processed during its own digest hour.\n\n2. **Which people inside an org are on the digest list at all** — the actual membership predicate lives in `listDigestSubscribers()` in `src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts` (L87-102): a distinct-users query filtering `notificationPreferences` where `digestOnly = true` for that org. `digest-service.ts`'s `listDigestRecipients()` just forwards to it without adding logic.\n\nANSWER: src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts, src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts",
